{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You navigate web pages to complete user tasks.\n\n# Coordinates\n\nOutput normalized coordinates in a 1000\u00d71000 space.\n\n# Structured JSON Output\n\nWhen the user requests structured data, include the results as valid JSON in your response inside a json markdown code fence. \nUse a JSON array for returning a list of items:\n```json\n[{\"key\": \"value1\"}, {\"key\": \"value2\"}]\n```\nUse a JSON object for returning a single entity:\n```json\n{\"key\": \"value\"}\n```"}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Add a Men's Wool Runner in size 11 and a Women's Wool Runner in size 8, both in the exact same non-black color. Then add an Anytime Heel Grip Sock and an Anytime Ankle Sock, both in Natural Black. Exactly 4 items. Add to cart.\n\n\nUser's location: San Francisco, CA, United States\nUser's timezone: America/Los_Angeles\nCurrent Date: April 14, 2026\nCurrent Time: 21:30:58 PDT\nToday is: Tuesday"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'll help you add those items to your cart. Let me start by finding the Men's Wool Runner first.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "chatcmpl-tool-897ff2f8caa11034", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "left_click", "arguments": "{\"coordinates\": [441, 96]}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Clicked 1x with left\nCurrent URL: https://www.allbirds.com/"}], "tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-897ff2f8caa11034"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I can see the Men's menu is open with \"Shoes\", \"Socks & Apparel\", and \"Sale\" options. Let me click on \"Shoes\" to find the Wool Runner.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "chatcmpl-tool-b2b521f6cdaccbda", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "left_click", "arguments": "{\"coordinates\": [425, 171]}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Clicked 1x with left\nCurrent URL: https://www.allbirds.com/"}], "tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b2b521f6cdaccbda"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I can see the Men's shoes menu. I don't see \"Wool Runner\" directly listed, but I see \"Sneakers\" which might contain it. Let me click on \"Sneakers\" to find the Wool Runner.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "chatcmpl-tool-9bd12720cb6a32e4", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "left_click", "arguments": "{\"coordinates\": [181, 334]}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Clicked 1x with left\nCurrent URL: https://www.allbirds.com/collections/mens-sneakers?a_ajs_event=Navigation+Clicked&a_ajs_prop_navigation_level_1=men&a_ajs_prop_navigation_level_2=shoes&a_ajs_prop_navigation_level_3=sneakers&a_ajs_prop_navigation_source=www.allbirds.com%2F&a_ajs_prop_navigation_type=level_3\n\n"}, {"type": "image_url", "image_url": {"url": "data:image/webp;base64,"}}], "tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9bd12720cb6a32e4"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "The page is showing a connection verification message. Let me wait for it to load.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "chatcmpl-tool-a656c771aad328e0", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "wait", "arguments": "{}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Waited 5.0s\nCurrent URL: https://www.allbirds.com/collections/mens-sneakers?a_ajs_event=Navigation+Clicked&a_ajs_prop_navigation_level_1=men&a_ajs_prop_navigation_level_2=shoes&a_ajs_prop_navigation_level_3=sneakers&a_ajs_prop_navigation_source=www.allbirds.com%2F&a_ajs_prop_navigation_type=level_3\n\n"}, {"type": "image_url", "image_url": {"url": "data:image/webp;base64,"}}], "tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a656c771aad328e0"}], "model": "qwen3-vl", "max_tokens": 512, "response_format": {"type": "structural_tag", "structures": [{"begin": "<tool_call>\n", "end": "\n</tool_call>", "schema": {"anyOf": [{"type": "object", "properties": {"name": {"enum": ["left_click", "double_click", "triple_click", "middle_click", "right_click", "scroll", "type", "key_press", "drag", "mouse_move", "mouse_down", "mouse_up", "go_back", "go_forward", "wait", "goto_url", "refresh